OL,3,GNEWSASouth West: Disruption caused by
OL,4,AMicrosoft outage
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusinesses, first responders and
OL,7,Ftransport companies in Devon and
OL,8,FCornwall have been affected by a
OL,9,Fnational Microsoft outage.
OL,11,FTeams, Outlook and AI software Copilot
OL,12,Fhave been affected and Microsoft said
OL,13,Fattempts to fix the issue so far were
OL,14,F"not taking as expected".
OL,16,FRoyal Devon NHS Trust said it was
OL,17,Funable to access emails and people who
OL,18,Fneeded to get in touch urgently should
OL,19,Fcall them.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
